PTX tearing+relaxed
"A 32-bit relaxed store and a 32-bit relaxed load of two 16-bit granules: morally strong, so single-copy atomic (8.10.3): no torn value. Expected: forbidden."
{
x[0]=0;
x[1]=0;
P1:r0[0]=0;
P1:r0[1]=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0          | P1@cta 1,gpu 0           ;
 st.relaxed.gpu.b32 x, 1 | ld.relaxed.gpu.b32 r0, x ;
exists
(P1:r0[0] == 1 /\ P1:r0[1] == 0)
